{
  "id": "JON.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "JON",
  "reference": "Yona 4",
  "verseCount": 11,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JON 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyarasta Yona ea baydeayda ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea moohoosana Yona ng'asheanji, hean ghwanyareas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamwaash NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayeesha, “Geamuscheey NG'UTAMIIDA, nih mii gidearukuneey aba damanda ghayi eandeewi ng'eanyiideanyu? Hean ghoah gideamng'awi ak geawi Darshishi; aba gideaba ghaanali ang'iing'i guwoosi ASEETA mideawa bariinyeega ea baydeayda, mii asas nyaras, bea bariinyeega huumwa, nea gisti ng'asheega munyas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, asi geamuscheey geanda eaweegeasu, aba gideaba ghang'wana ghaameayi mwasamwa gideaba geabiidi ng'eanyiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA, “Ghamneawa iinyareasi gisini gida doabiiwi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwariteawa Yona jeeda mujiini, ak goopteada aba gayeewda mujiini, ak gwadeeksa geaw meandiida aba hoowa. Ak goopteada aba guumda heeda was jirooneadaanyi, ea ghwadaah gichea eesima mujiini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gooruudu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA geeta, ak ghwanung' gageawiit ea ghwanaawa Yona, ak ghoah jirooneeda aba uhuudaanyi, jea ghaweat aba jeeda sawanadeadaanyi. Hean goohoosan Yona geetida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu nea ghaghar gayeew eaweeda niirja goojeagu ASEETA ghupcheeda ak ghwaak geetida, ak hean ghwasis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea goorearu aseeta, goojeagu ASEETA jeameeda ng'waan leabu gayeew, hean ghwalas daknooda uhuuda Yona ea ghoahiil; ea gwayi bwak ea gagasa miyeeda, ak gwayi, “Ghang'wana ghaameayi ea meabiidani ng'eanyiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Yona, “Ghamneawa gisini gida doabiiwi iinyareasi aba ng'asheega geeta?” Hean gwayeesha, “Ghwadoabiiw iyaanyareaschi danyareas ea dami.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA, “Ang'iing'i gibwaydi geeta mii gadiyeesiina, nea ea minung' gwaheedu, ridu eaweecheanjagi ak ghaghajaamiit eaweecheanjagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JON 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aniini ea maydabwayda Ninaawiheeda was mujiineeda haw, mida jeeda fuga naawa sagalamnyooji bughala ea diktam mwanala gida mida meatkweeda geatinda dugwa ghana geatinda ghaadaam, ak gwandeawa eara dugwa saang'a?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JON.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JON.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
